# .qwgignore — Exclusions for `qwg index` (.qwcache codebase memory packs).
# Follows gitignore(5) syntax alongside .gitignore and .git/info/exclude.

# Vendored third-party header templates and raw Metal shader sources
# (Remove `Sources/QWMetal/` if indexing MSL shader bodies explicitly)
Sources/QWMetal/

# Auto-generated CLI options and hardcoded numeric lookup tables
Sources/Apps/qwg/Generated/
Sources/QWMetal/gdn/qwgdn_prefill_tables.h

# Bundled static Web UI HTML/CSS/JS asset
Sources/Apps/QWServer/Resources/

# Test fixtures, golden data blobs, and build/verification helper scripts
Tests/**/Fixtures/
Tests/**/fixtures/
Scripts/

# Repository legal/governance boilerplate
LICENSE
CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
SECURITY.md
CITATION.cff
